### Generation Pipeline
- `generator.py` (v17) — retry x2, admin email alert on failure, clean 503 to user, `model_used` in response
- `prompt_engine.py` (v13) — zone-aware layering, skin-tone aware contour prompt, mascara improved, cheek prompts improved
- `main.py` (updated) — queue-based, `/generate` + `/generate-combo` return `job_id` instantly, no longer calls Gemini directly
- `worker.py` — polls DB every 3 seconds, picks up `pending` jobs, calls Gemini, updates status to `complete` or `failed`
- `GET /jobs/{job_id}` — client polls this for status: `pending → processing → complete → failed`
- Combo blocked for cheeks zone — single product only
- Dockerfile + .dockerignore written, ready for Fargate migration when needed

### API Flow (UI Integration Ready)
```
POST /upload          → get upload_path
GET /brands           → brand list
GET /brands/{brand}/categories → categories
GET /brands/{brand}/{category}/products → products
GET /products/{id}/shades → shades
POST /generate        → get job_id instantly
GET /jobs/{job_id}    → poll every 3s until complete
```

